45	/// the `tsrs` builds listed exactly (`<tsrs version>-ts<typescript version>`), each only while its TypeScript part is
46	/// in the series above. The protocol has no version handshake, so the package's `package.json` version and the
47	/// initialize call that follows the spawn are the whole check; a build that fails either takes the structural result
48	/// with one warning.
